  "verdict": "MACRO_AT_INITIALIZATION_MOVES_THE_START_NOT_THE_DYNAMICS",
  "the_finding": "BOTH arms reached their final best at charged call 48 and did not improve once over the remaining 202 calls (control 0.4583 flat, treatment 0.4815 flat). The macro seats bought a better starting molecule -- +0.0232 best -- and bought essentially nothing on the benchmark metric: +0.0016 top-ten and +0.0012 AUC. Seeding a better molecule does not change what ordinary COMPOSE search does from it.",
  "why_this_matters": "It is the dead-basin signature at whole-campaign scale, and it reproduces the standing observation that deco_hop, qed and zaleplon each found their best at charged call 48 and then spent ~1,000 further calls without one improvement. The lever is therefore NOT better initialization; it is selecting a macro by what search REACHES from it, which is what the continuation tournament measures."
